{"baseRefName":"fix/lifecycle-destructive","baseRefOid":"4093fcfeea54abdec307c413aa8fab0832a67581","body":"## Summary\n\nStacked on #540. Two provider-ledger defects from the reliability audit:\n\n- **Typed failure flattening** — AnimeGG and KickAssAnime caught every fetch error and reported `network-error` (retryable), so a 429 throttle, a 403 edge refusal, or a 5xx outage all produced identical ledger entries: throttled endpoints got retry-stormed and fallback ordering was misled. A shared `classifyProviderFetchFailure` now reads the typed `ProviderHttpError` through (status-derived code + retryability), with `isProviderTimeoutError` owned in one place.\n- **Dead deferred streams were unforgettable** — AllManga Ak candidates carry `deferredLocator` handles minted per-resolve (`allmanga-ak:<ts>-<n>`). The dead-stream ledger recorded that locator, so the next resolve's fresh locator never matched and the dead pick was retried forever. A stable `contentKey` (upstream video URL) now threads `StreamLink → StreamCandidate → StreamInfo`, and record/block both use `contentKey ?? url ?? deferredLocator`.\n\n#### Test plan\n\n- [x] New `shared-resolve-helpers.test.ts` pins the status→code map (429→rate-limited, 403→blocked, 503→provider-unavailable, timeout, untyped).\n- [x] KAA 503 test updated to the real classification (`provider-unavailable`).\n- [x] New resolver test: a deferred candidate whose `contentKey` is in `blockedStreamUrls` is skipped for the alternate even though its locator is freshly minted.\n- [x] Pre-push gate: 26 tasks, 5,9xx unit + 296 integration, 0 fail; anti-slop baseline ratcheted -1.","files":[{"path":"apps/cli/src/app/playback/PlaybackPhase.ts","additions":3,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/domain/types.ts","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/services/playback/PlaybackResolveService.ts","additions":14,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/services/providers/provider-result-adapter.ts","additions":3,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/test/unit/services/playback/playback-resolve-service.test.ts","additions":61,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/allmanga/api-client.ts","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/allmanga/direct.ts","additions":4,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/animegg/direct.ts","additions":17,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/animekai/client.ts","additions":14,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/hianime/client.ts","additions":7,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/kickassanime/direct.ts","additions":36,"deletions":6,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/shared/direct-stream-source.ts","additions":2,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/shared/resolve-helpers.ts","additions":31,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/test/kickassanime.test.ts","additions":2,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/test/shared-resolve-helpers.test.ts","additions":54,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"packages/types/src/index.ts","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"tools/oxlint/anti-slop/baseline.json","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"fix/provider-classification","headRefOid":"027a89391c10c5cbb76685197a318a59b52a8c4a","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":541,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T22:57:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37075169743/job/111063317722","name":"Path filters","startedAt":"2026-10-02T22:57:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-